{"id":"cb22ca38-a7aa-420f-9095-eb4744221d05","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243549,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT ROUND(\n  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM refunds r WHERE r.order_id = o.order_id))::numeric\n  / NULLIF(COUNT(*), 0),\n  4\n) AS refund_order_ratio\nFROM orders o;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答SQL。需要理解：全部订单中有过任意退款记录的订单占比。不排订单状态，按订单去重，输出0到1小数四位，分母0时NULL。\n\n需要一条SELECT。分母订单总数 count(*) from orders? 全部订单。分子有过任意退款记录的订单数，按订单去重。refunds 可能有多个退款记录同订单。需要 count distinct r.order_id 或 distinct orders with exists. 占比 = count(distinct refunds.order_id) / count(orders.order_id) 注意只算退款订单在orders中的？ \"全部订单中有过任意退款记录\" 分子应订单在全部订单中且存在退款。如果 refunds 有孤儿订单？FK? 可能是约定。应该用 orders LEFT JOIN refunds 或 EXISTS。按订单去重且不排状态。输出小数四位，ROUND(...::numeric,4)。分母0 NULLIF.\n\nSQL:\nSELECT ROUND(\n COUNT(DISTINCT r.order_id)::numeric / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id),0), 4\n) AS refund_order_ratio\nFROM orders o\nLEFT JOIN refunds r ON r.order_id = o.order_id;\n\n这样 COUNT(DISTINCT r.order_id) 只算 orders 中匹配的退款订单，且按订单去重。分母 orders distinct. orders PK so count(*) okay. 但如果 refunds 多行，COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) unaffected. 为避免重复, left join. 结果一行，聚合无group，无需limit? Rule 3 单行无GROUP BY的COUNT/SUM/AVG等聚合除外。可以不加limit. 输出别名。需要0到1小数四位。ROUND numeric.\n\nCheck \"有过任意退款记录\" 不要求退款状态，任意记录包括待审核等。不排订单状态。分母全部订单。按订单去重。用 LEFT JOIN.\n\nPotential issue if refunds contains order_id not in orders: not counted numerator, which aligns \"全部订单中\". Good.\n\nCould do EXISTS to avoid duplicates:\nSELECT ROUND(\n COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM refunds r WHERE r.order_id = o.order_id))::numeric / NULLIF(COUNT(*),0),4)\nFROM orders o;\nThis counts orders with any refund and denominator. Simpler no overcount. Uses FILTER aggregate. COUNT(*) with FILTER returns bigint. Numeric cast. If orders empty? left join count distinct returns 0 denominator 0 -> NULL. EXISTS version also 0/0 null. Both okay. Use EXISTS maybe robust and \"按订单去重\". But when counting numerator: COUNT(*) FILTER where exists. Yes.\n\nNeed only output SQL. No code fences. Ensure no quoting. Column names lower. The SQL uses refunds table. The \"不排订单状态\" no filter. \"输出0到1小数四位\" ROUND(...,4).\n\nSELECT ROUND(\n  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM refunds r WHERE r.order_id = o.order_id))::numeric\n  / NULLIF(COUNT(*), 0),\n  4\n) AS refund_order_ratio\nFROM orders o;\n\nCould denominator count all orders; if no orders aggregate returns one row with 0 numerator? Actually count(*)=0, count filter=0, division null => ROUND(NULL,4) null. Good.\n\nNeed maybe alias \"ratio\". Fine.\n\nFinal answer only SQL."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2910,"completion_tokens":781,"total_tokens":3691,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2688},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":723},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2688,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":222},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}